#: src/OpenGoldBox/godot/locale/dynamic_sources.json:1
msgid "Level 3 spell slots and Wizard spells: Animate Dead, Bestow Curse, Blink, Counterspell, Dispel Magic, Fear, Fireball, Haste, Hypnotic Pattern, Lightning Bolt, Magic Circle, Protection from Energy, Remove Curse, Sleet Storm, Stinking Cloud, Tiny Hut and Vampiric Touch.\nMemorize Spell: after a Short Rest, change one prepared spell for another in your spellbook.\nProficiency Bonus +3."
