#: src/OpenGoldBox/godot/locale/dynamic_sources.json:1
msgid "Oath of Devotion: Smite of Protection. When you cast Divine Smite, you and allies in your Aura of Protection gain +2 AC and +2 to Dexterity saves until your next turn.\nA second level 4 spell slot."
